---
---

<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <title>Tack Test | RingStatus</title>
    <meta name="description" content="A Webflow Cloud Astro test page using a large RS3-style page section." />

    <style>
      html,
      body {
        min-height: 100%;
        margin: 0;
      }

      body.rs2_body {
        background-color: rgb(219, 213, 206);
        color: #111;
        font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      }

      .rs3-page,
      .rs3-page * {
        box-sizing: border-box;
      }

      .rs3-page {
        overflow-x: hidden;
        width: 100%;
        background-color: rgb(219, 213, 206);
      }

      .rs3-shell {
        width: 100%;
      }

      .rs3-wrapper {
        width: 100%;
        max-width: 1180px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        padding-right: 24px;
        padding-left: 24px;
      }

      .rs3-panel.is-active {
        display: block;
        padding: 0;
        font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
        font-size: 18px;
        line-height: 1.45;
      }

      .rs3-hero {
        width: 100%;
        margin-top: 0;
        padding: 72px 0 72px;
        background-image: none;
        color: #111;
      }

      .rs3-hero-inner {
        max-width: 980px;
      }

      .eyebrow-2 {
        margin-bottom: 18px;
        font-size: 13px;
        line-height: 1;
        letter-spacing: 0.08em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        color: #555;
      }

      .rs3-title {
        max-width: 980px;
        margin: 0 0 28px;
        font-size: clamp(48px, 8vw, 112px);
        line-height: 0.95;
        font-weight: 500;
        letter-spacing: -0.045em;
      }

      .rs3-lede {
        max-width: 760px;
        margin: 0;
        font-size: clamp(22px, 3vw, 38px);
        line-height: 1.12;
        color: #111;
      }

      .rs3-s {
        width: 100%;
        margin-top: 0;
        padding: 64px 0;
        background-color: #f7f4ed;
        color: #111;
      }

      .rs3-s.no-shade {
        background-color: rgb(219, 213, 206);
      }

      .rs3-grid {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 0.85fr 1.15fr;
        gap: 48px;
        align-items: start;
      }

      .rs3-h2 {
        margin: 0 0 22px;
        font-size: clamp(34px, 5vw, 72px);
        line-height: 1;
        font-weight: 500;
        letter-spacing: -0.035em;
      }

      .p-medium {
        margin: 0;
        max-width: 650px;
        font-size: 18px;
        line-height: 1.45;
        color: #333;
      }

      .text-span {
        color: #111;
      }

      .rs3-media {
        width: 100%;
        overflow: hidden;
        border-radius: 18px;
        background: #d0c9c1;
      }

      .rs3-media img {
        display: block;
        width: 100%;
        height: auto;
      }

      .rs3-cards {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
        gap: 18px;
      }

      .rs3-card {
        min-height: 220px;
        padding: 24px;
        border-top: 1px solid #111;
        background: rgba(247, 244, 237, 0.72);
      }

      .rs3-card h3 {
        margin: 0 0 12px;
        font-size: 24px;
        line-height: 1.1;
        font-weight: 500;
      }

      .rs3-card p {
        margin: 0;
        font-size: 17px;
        line-height: 1.45;
        color: #333;
      }

      .rs3-auto {
        width: 100%;
        height: auto;
        margin-top: 0;
        padding: 64px 0 88px;
        background-color: #f7f4ed;
        color: #111;
      }

      .rs3-auto.no-shade {
        background-color: rgb(219, 213, 206);
      }

      .rs3-statement {
        max-width: 780px;
      }

      .rs3-h3 {
        margin: 0 0 18px;
        font-size: clamp(30px, 4vw, 58px);
        line-height: 1;
        font-weight: 500;
        letter-spacing: -0.03em;
      }

      .rs3-para2 {
        margin: 0;
        font-size: 18px;
        line-height: 1.45;
        color: #333;
      }

      .rs3-placeholder-top,
      .rs3-placeholder-bottom {
        padding: 24px;
        border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(17, 17, 17, 0.15);
        font-size: 14px;
        color: #555;
      }

      .rs3-placeholder-bottom {
        border-top: 1px solid rgba(17, 17, 17, 0.15);
        border-bottom: 0;
      }

      @media screen and (max-width: 991px) {
        .rs3-page {
          position: relative;
        }

        .rs3-grid {
          grid-template-columns: 1fr;
          gap: 36px;
        }
      }

      @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {
        .rs3-wrapper {
          padding-right: 20px;
          padding-left: 20px;
        }

        .rs3-hero {
          padding-top: 56px;
          padding-bottom: 56px;
        }

        .rs3-s,
        .rs3-auto {
          padding-top: 52px;
          padding-bottom: 60px;
        }

        .rs3-cards {
          grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        }

        .rs3-title {
          letter-spacing: -0.035em;
        }
      }

      @media screen and (max-width: 479px) {
        .rs3-page {
          min-width: 320px;
        }
      }
    </style>
  </head>

  <body class="rs2_body">
    <div class="rs3-placeholder-top">
      Header placeholder — future site navigation goes here.
    </div>

    <main class="rs3-shell">
      <section class="rs3-page">
        <section class="rs3-panel is-active">
          <section class="rs3-hero">
            <div class="rs3-wrapper">
              <div class="rs3-hero-inner">
                <div class="eyebrow-2">About Me</div>
                <h1 class="rs3-title">I built this because being ready matters.</h1>
                <p class="rs3-lede">
                  I am a junior rider and working student. I ride a lot, work a lot, and spend enough time at shows to know when something is making the day harder than it needs to be.
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </section>

          <section class="rs3-s no-shade">
            <div class="rs3-wrapper">
              <div class="rs3-grid">
                <div>
                  <div class="eyebrow-2">Me</div>
                  <h2 class="rs3-h2">Show days are not calm.</h2>
                  <p class="p-medium">
                    Show days are not calm. You still have to be ready. I started building simple tools because I needed a better way to keep track of horses, timing, packing, grooms, and rings without digging through a heavy app every five minutes.
                    <span class="text-span">I know what needs to work because I am using it while getting horses ready, checking the ring, and trying not to make anyone wait.</span>
                  </p>
                </div>

                <div class="rs3-media">
                  <img
                    src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6982268b7543ac3c80151266/69ef980833ad820a005542da_ring6.avif"
                    alt=""
                    loading="lazy"
                  />
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </section>

          <section class="rs3-s">
            <div class="rs3-wrapper">
              <div class="eyebrow-2">Barn Tools</div>

              <div class="rs3-cards">
                <article class="rs3-card">
                  <h3>I work a lot.</h3>
                  <p>I pack, prep, check timing, help with horses, and keep moving when the day changes.</p>
                </article>

                <article class="rs3-card">
                  <h3>I ride a lot.</h3>
                  <p>I ride different types, including the hard ones, and I learn fast because I have to.</p>
                </article>

                <article class="rs3-card">
                  <h3>I had help building it.</h3>
                  <p>I bring the show-day problems from the barn. My dad helps turn them into simple tools that work.</p>
                </article>
              </div>
            </div>
          </section>

          <section class="rs3-auto no-shade">
            <div class="rs3-wrapper">
              <div class="rs3-statement">
                <div class="eyebrow-2">Mission</div>
                <h3 class="rs3-h3">Not fancy. Just useful.</h3>
                <p class="rs3-para2">
                  This was not something handed off to a developer. It came from real show weeks, long days, moving rings, and needing better answers fast.
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </section>
        </section>
      </section>
    </main>

    <div class="rs3-placeholder-bottom">
      Footer placeholder — future sections can continue below this module.
    </div>
  </body>
</html>